 Client plugins call ctx.chatPresentation.preserveReplies(preset) to keep every reply-bearing Assistant step visible in Compact mode for that preset. Reasoning within those steps and separate Tool rows still fold. Registrations are effects; disposal restores ordinary behavior. The policy applies equally to live and restored history without changing model requests or the persisted Normal/Compact preference.
+
+The conversation.chat.turn-actions chain can replace the default fork controls for a complete turn, including one without closing text. It receives the turn and its raw closing coordinate. Selectors remain pure functions of their owner props.
+
+Client plugins call ctx.chatPresentation.preserveUserInputs(producer) to show replayed user input as ordinary user bubbles. The logged producer stays intact, and other injected messages keep their context presentation. Registration and disposal update loaded and live messages. The conversation.chat.user-actions list adds actions beside a user bubble and supplies its raw message sequence.
